@startuml Transaction State Diagram
[*] --> Created : Transaction added

Created --> Updated : Transaction updated
Created --> Deleted : Transaction deleted

Updated --> Updated : Transaction updated again
Updated --> Deleted : Transaction deleted

Deleted --> [*] : Transaction removed

note right of Created
Initial state after creation
end note

note right of Updated
State after modification
end note

note right of Deleted
Final state, transaction removed
end note
@enduml